images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Stunned Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div></td><td class=\"mbox-text\"><div class=\"mbox-text-span\">This is a disambiguation page, which links to ambiguously named articles. If you were <a href=\"/wiki/Special:WhatLinksHere/Safe_Key\" title=\"Special:WhatLinksHere/Safe Key\">brought here</a> by a link in an article, consider editing it to direct towards the intended page instead.</div></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><b>Safe Key</b> may refer to a number of <a href=\"/wiki/Keys\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Keys\">keys</a> that unlock various <a href=\"/wiki/Safe\" title=\"Safe\">safes</a> throughout the game:\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Figaro%27s_Safe_Key\" title=\"Figaro's Safe Key\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/22/Key_Iron_A_Icon.png/30px-Key_Iron_A_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/22/Key_Iron_A_Icon.png/45px-Key_Iron_A_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/22/Key_Iron_A_Icon.png/60px-Key_Iron_A_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/22/Key_Iron_A_Icon.png/30px-Key_Iron_A_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/22/Key_Iron_A_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Figaro%27s_Safe_Key\" title=\"Figaro's Safe Key\">Figaro's Safe Key</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gortash%27s_Key\" title=\"Gortash's Key\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/Key_Gold_A_Icon.png/30px-Key_Gold_A_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ec/Key_Gold_A_Icon.png/45px-Key_Gold_A_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ec/Key_Gold_A_Icon.png/60px-Key_Gold_A_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/Key_Gold_A_Icon.png/30px-Key_Gold_A_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ec/Key_Gold_A_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Gortash%27s_Key\" title=\"Gortash's Key\">Gortash's Key</a></span> - Carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Enver_Gortash\" title=\"Enver Gortash\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png/25px-Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png/38px-Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png/50px-Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Enver Gortash\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png/25px-Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/59/Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Enver_Gortash\" title=\"Enver Gortash\">Enver Gortash</a>\n<ul><li>Unlocks a wall safe in <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wyrm%27s_Rock_Fortress#Gortash's_Private_Chambers\" title=\"Wyrm's Rock Fortress\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/38px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/50px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gortash's Private Chambers\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Wyrm%27s_Rock_Fortress#Gortash's_Private_Chambers\" title=\"Wyrm's Rock Fortress\">Gortash's Private Chambers</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-34&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;202</span></li></ul></li>\n<li>Nine-Finger's safe key - Carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nine-Fingers_Keene\" title=\"Nine-Fingers Keene\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/56/Portrait_Nine-Fingers_Keene.png/25px-Portrait_Nine-Fingers_Keene.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/56/Portrait_Nine-Fingers_Keene.png/38px-Portrait_Nine-Fingers_Keene.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/56/Portrait_Nine-Fingers_Keene.png/50px-Portrait_Nine-Fingers_Keene.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Nine-Fingers Keene\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/56/Portrait_Nine-Fingers_Keene.png/25px-Portrait_Nine-Fingers_Keene.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/56/Portrait_Nine-Fingers_Keene.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Nine-Fingers_Keene\" title=\"Nine-Fingers Keene\">Nine-Fingers Keene</a>\n<ul><li>Unlocks a safe door leading to the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Guildhall#Secret_Sewer_Vault\" title=\"Guildhall\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/38px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/50px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Secret Sewer Vault\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Guildhall#Secret_Sewer_Vault\" title=\"Guildhall\">Secret Sewer Vault</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Highberry%27s_Strongbox_Key\" title=\"Highberry's Strongbox Key\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4d/Key_Silver_A_Icon.png/30px-Key_Silver_A_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4d/Key_Silver_A_Icon.png/45px-Key_Silver_A_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4d/Key_Silver_A_Icon.png/60px-Key_Silver_A_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4d/Key_Silver_A_Icon.png/30px-Key_Silver_A_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4d/Key_Silver_A_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Highberry%27s_Strongbox_Key\" title=\"Highberry's Strongbox Key\">Highberry's Strongbox Key</a></span>\n<ul><li>Unlocks a 'Srongbox' hidden behind a painting in the wall of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Highberry%27s_Home#Basement\" title=\"Highberry's Home\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/38px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/50px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Highberry's Basement\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Highberry%27s_Home#Basement\" title=\"Highberry's Home\">Highberry's Basement</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Key_From_Raphael%27s_Safe\" title=\"Key From Raphael's Safe\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/Key_Gold_A_Icon.png/30px-Key_Gold_A_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ec/Key_Gold_A_Icon.png/45px-Key_Gold_A_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ec/Key_Gold_A_Icon.png/60px-Key_Gold_A_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/Key_Gold_A_Icon.png/30px-Key_Gold_A_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ec/Key_Gold_A_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Key_From_Raphael%27s_Safe\" title=\"Key From Ra